      "short": "Painting of two people on a flower-covered cliff overlooking a blue-green sea with sailboats and clouds.",
      "long": "A horizontally oriented painting depicts a seaside cliff covered in dense, colorful vegetation—greens, pinks, yellows—with two figures standing near the edge. One figure holds a vivid red parasol. Below, a dynamic sea rendered in dabs of blue, green, white, and gray shows ripples and small white sailboats. The sky above is pale blue with scattered white cumulus clouds. The entire surface shows visible, textured brushwork.",
